{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47207","headline":"春日旅怀呈知己 · 惟审","name":"春日旅怀呈知己","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"生涯万事有苍苍，应任流萍便越乡。\n春水独行人渐远，故园归梦夜空长。\n一声隔浦猨啼处，数滴惊心泪满裳。\n不爲知音皆鲍叔，信谁江上去茫茫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"惟审","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47207.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47207","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}